                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "My first bullet hell I've put time into. Is that a good thing? I think so. Sure, the game's tough, but that's to be expected from games of the genre. The music is immaculate. DEKU is a national treasure, and there's not a single song in the game that I'd consider bad. The characters are great, fitting with the depressing atmosphere. As of writing, I've currently beat the entire game on Easy, and have reached [spoiler] Stage EX [/spoiler] on normal. I think its safe to say I love this game.",
